MODIFICATIONS OF THE ORACLE'S CSA SOURCES
=========================================
code/oracle/csa/ is Goldberg and Kennedy's CSA 1.2 (precise-costs variant, built as
csa_q: -DQUEUE_ORDER) as distributed by the 13th DIMACS Implementation Challenge,
Network Flows 2.0 (csa-flows20.tar.gz, md5 e07d8ad4b68bba1096f39eba7cfd7dda), turned
into a library callable from the verified solver; setup_libraries.sh makes it from
the tarball and this diff.  Every change is guarded by
CSA_LIBRARY and described in README_solver.md, section 'The oracle'.
code/oracle/pristine_csa/ holds the unmodified files (csa/prec_costs/*.c overriding
csa/*.c as the distribution's own build does), and this is the complete diff,
line endings ignored (the distribution uses CRLF):

